# ChromaFlow safety

- Do not write sysfs `pwm*` or `pwm*_enable`. There is no PWM write API in this milestone.
- Do not add `set_pwm` or equivalent. Failsafe + watchdog + daemon must exist first.
- Do not run or document the GUI/`chromaflow` CLI as root. Polkit helper only.
- `modprobe` names come only from YAML allowlist matching `^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$`. Never DMI/lspci → modprobe.
- Do not bundle `.ko` files. Do not copy Fan Control or OpenRGB source trees.
- OpenRGB: `127.0.0.1` only. Do not fake Windows-only devices.
- Warn if CoolerControl, fancontrol, or fan2go is already running.
